Build and maintain relationships with stakeholders such as, but not limited to, the banking and asset management sectors for purposes of gathering market intelligence.
Ensure the transfer of knowledge and skills to junior specialists, which includes providing technical support and monitoring the application thereof.
Perform ad hoc tasks as required.
Qualifications
