The successful candidate will be expected to lead multiple engagements, manage and coach junior team members (who in turn are responsible for day-to-day transaction execution, financial modelling and analysis), build and strengthen client relationships, and provide high-quality advice to clients. The role requires a high degree of independence, strong technical capability and a genuine interest in the infrastructure sector.
