Minimum Post Graduate Degree; LLB
An admitted Attorney in good standing.
LLM/MBA/MBL would be an added advantage.
Preferably 8 – 10 years’ relevant experience post admission as an Attorney and a sound track record in the financial services industry
5 to 7 years’ experience in a broad range of commercial transactions typically concluded in a financing environment
Sound knowledge of litigation processes
Sound knowledge of legal recovery and policy formulation
